\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF says no comment on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  rumour. \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1999\par 14:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, June 18 (Reuters) - A Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) official declined to comment on Friday about market rumours of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that pushed the euro sharply higher in European trading. \par \par \uc2  Asked about the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the official said: "No comment." \par \par \uc2  The euro quickly rose as much as two yen and half a cent against the dollar on the rumours of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales of yen for the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan was not immediately available for comment. \par \par \uc2  Customarily, the BOJ would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through other central banks on its behalf when it has to conduct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  outside of the Tokyo market hours, traders said. \par \par \uc2  One Tokyo banker said that his bank's branch office in Europe has not detected any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "It's a rumour so far. We've still haven't detected the BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  Another senior trader said the trading could represent normal \b \highlight22\uc2 forex operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He said the ECB may have been acting at Tokyo's request to boost Japan's external reserves in the euro. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 5473-3748 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6i068uy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
