\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  recruits ECB for yen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Swaha Pattanaik \par \uc2 821 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1999\par 22:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, June 18 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit the foreign exchanges with its third bout of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in less than two weeks Friday, using the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell yen for euros to curb the strength of the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The euro leaped more than three yen from a lifetime low of 122.60 yen while the dollar leaped as much as nearly two yen from session lows of 119.00 in the wake of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  By the end of the U.S. session, however, the yen had pared some of its losses as the U.S. Federal Reserve stayed away from the action. \par \par \uc2  The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed the action, which marked the first time it has been involved in any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exercise since the launch of the euro in January. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the ECB used the national central banks as the conduit for its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with the Bundesbank, the Bank of France and the Bank of Italy all cited. They said the total \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was rumoured to have been between $2 billion and $3 billion and was conducted with up to 20 banks. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came as leaders from the Group of Eight nations - the Group of Seven industrial nations and Russia - met in Cologne, Germany, and was seen as a strong signal of Japan's commitment to preventing yen strength from damaging the country's nascent economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  President Clinton told Japanese Prime Minister Keizo Obuchi Friday to use all tools at his disposal to spur Japanese growth, a top White House official said. \par \par \uc2  "The Japanese authorities are quite clearly concerned about this so-called premature appreciation of the yen," said Jeremy Hawkins, chief economic adviser at Bank of America in London. \par \par \uc2  "It is not just the case of yen gains against the dollar but concerns about it making too much ground against Europe and losing key export markets there." \par \par \uc2  The action was the first time the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  through another \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since mid-1998. On that occasion it used the Federal Reserve Bank of New York, which acts on behalf of the U.S. Treasury, to buy yen for dollars. \par \par \uc2  The Treasury and the Federal Reserve declined to comment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Bank of England, traditionally an agent for Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during European hours, also declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials have repeatedly warned traders that they would keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the yen strengthened too far, with senior Japanese Finance Ministry official Eisuke Sakakibara making the point overnight. \par \par \uc2  "A premature yen strengthening before an economic recovery is not desirable," said Sakakibara, who has been dubbed "Mr. Yen" by dealers for his ability to move markets. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on euro/yen could also have been prompted by a desire to limit the losses Japanese investors suffer because of their exposure to euro-denominated assets, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Japanese investors had stocked up on such assets when the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was launched in January and have been hard hit as the euro has since declined more than 7 percent against the yen. \par \par \uc2  "This is beneficial to both sides as it gives the euro a leg up, but the main thing is it underlines the Japanese authorities' willingness to take the market on," Mark Cliffe, chief economist at ING Barings in London, said. \par \par \uc2  The yen was at 125.15/19 per euro and 120.51/56 per dollar, while the euro was up at $1.0416/18 from session lows of $1.0295 which were within half a cent of lifetime lows hit earlier this month. \par \par \uc2  Market sources said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in euro/yen rather than dollar/yen was likely to have been determined by the risk that yen strength against the euro would spill over into its value against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The yen's peaks against the euro Friday were equivalent to about 62.69 per mark, the strongest it had been since August 1997 and within striking distance of the yen's best levels since 1995. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ can read charts as well as anyone in the market," a banking source said. "Euro/yen was the weak link and while they (the BOJ) had some sort of control over dollar/yen the risk was they would lose control over euro/yen." \par \par \uc2  By late afternoon in New York, (1600 EDT / 2000 GMT) the euro stood at 125.08 yen, up sharply from overnight lows but off three-quarters of a yen from the day's high. The dollar traded at 120.45 yen, also below highs but still up sharply from the previous day's close. \par \par \uc2  The euro gained, which rode its rally against the yen to strengthen against the dollar, stood at $1.0390, up half a cent from Thursday's finish. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6i06240\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
