\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Fear Of BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Supports Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1999\par 07:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the euro was quoted at Y123.73, down from Y124.01 in New York late Wednesday and below Y123.93 in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "It's impossible to imagine that the euro/yen will go up," said Toru Okuni, vice president and chief dealer at Toronto Dominion Bank in Tokyo. The euro is seen finding initial support around Y123.50, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But market players remain cautious about pushing the dollar too far down against the yen for fear that their brashness would be met by wrath from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "People are well aware that the BOJ would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the trading company dealer. \par \par \uc2  Initial support for the dollar is seen around Y119.80. Dealers noted stop-loss orders to sell the dollar between Y119.50-Y119.70. \par \par \uc2  "There may be an attempt to trigger those orders when London and New York players come into the market," the trading company dealer said. \par \par \uc2  News early in the session that Japan's current account for April narrowed from a year earlier at a faster pace than forecast had little impact on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the nation's current account surplus shriveled 16.5% to Y885.4 billion before adjustment for seasonal factors. The pace of contraction was steeper than the 2.7% drop to Y1.031 trillion that economists in Tokyo were expecting. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at $1.5905, up from $1.5878 in New York late Wednesday. Sterling was at $1.5890 in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Arran Scott (813-5255-2929; amscott@ap.org) \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0546GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6h04k9i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
