\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  CROSS-Yen advances inexorably on hounded euro. \b0\par\par\uc2 589 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1999\par 09:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, June 17 (Reuters) - The yen rose inexorably on the euro on Thursday as new-found strength in Japanese equities and yields compounded long-standing gloom over Europe. \par \par \uc2  An outbreak of optimism on the Japanese economy saw the Nikkei climb to a 20-month peak and drove JGB yields higher, so flattering the yen's interest differentials. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said this turn of events made Japanese investors more eager than ever to hedge or exit euro positions built up last year when the average euro/yen rate was at 130.00 or more. The resulting selling hounded the hapless euro down to 123.77/87 yen by 0630 GMT from 125.74/84 here on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  That was not far from the lifetime low around 123.18 hit last week and left the euro in a miserable technical position, with many analysts tipping a break towards 121.65 - a trough from 1997 derived using the old Ecu/yen rate. \par \par \uc2  The euro had also been pressured by a relief rally in U.S. assets markets after benign inflation data there lessened the pressure for an aggressive tightening in policy. \par \par \uc2  Traders said investors had happily switched back to U.S. assets using funds drawn largely from the euro, leaving the yen almost unscathed in the process. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, they noted the offshore mood was becoming decidedly less chilly towards Japan, with Merrill Lynch for one recommending clients increase their portfolio weightings of Japanese equities to 13.75 percent from 11.64 percent. \par \par \uc2  Such portfolio flows would tend to support the yen and so made it all the more urgent for Japanese investors to hedge their extensive euro exposure. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said this cycle was making life difficult for the Bank of Japan since the flows into yen/euro were also tending to lift the yen against the U.S. dollar, so undoing the gains made by Monday's dlr/yen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some even suspected the BOJ's massive dollar buying \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been aimed as much at propping up euro/yen as dlr/yen. \par \par \uc2  There were rumours on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had at least checked rates to put a floor under the dollar and might have enlisted the help of Kampo, the Postal Life Insurance System, to quietly buy euro/yen. \par \par \uc2  "There's no doubt the weakness of euro/yen is capping dollar/yen at the moment, and that's a big problem for the BOJ," said Ken Landon, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Deutsche. \par \par \uc2  If supporting the euro was an aim, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had failed miserably with euro/yen now below where it was before the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts said. \par \par \uc2  This in turn was eating into \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's competitiveness. \par \par \uc2  Current account data for April out on Thursday showed a hefty 7.9 percent drop in exports to Europe, year-on-year, a fourth straight month of falls, and analysts noted the decline was on an accelerating trend. \par \par \uc2  All of which argued for more drastic action by the BOJ and many felt it was only a matter of time before the bank would have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in euro/yen. \par \par \uc2  The yen's rehabilitation showed on other crosses where it neared five month highs against the Swiss franc and crept higher on sterling. \par \par \uc2  The latter has troubles of its own at the moment as weak inflation data earlier this week reignited speculation of another U.K. rate cut. ((Wayne Cole, Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 8584 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6h06d19\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
