rn for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  ((Lisa Jucca, London Capital Markets +44-171-542-6745, elisabetta.jucca@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6f06hfr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
