\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ's yen battle seen hinging on money-market ploy. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Swaha Pattanaik \par \uc2 545 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 1999\par 12:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, June 15 (Reuters) - Japan's battle to curb yen strength is at a critical juncture, with the success of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen dependent on whether the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  mops up the yen it has flooded into the market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers are expecting the Japanese money market to be awash with excess liquidity on Wednesday, the settlement date for Monday's yen spending spree by the Bank of Japan which is rumoured to have totalled more than $5 billion. \par \par \uc2  If the Bank of Japan soaks up this excess liquidity in its money-market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a process known as sterilisation, it will negate the impact of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  typically buys or sells short-term instruments on a daily basis to steer money market interest rates. \par \par \uc2  If it doesn't sterilise its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , money-market rates will be dented and the yen should fall back almost immediately, analysts said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will send a very strong signal to the market that if they want the yen, the Japanese will carry on printing it until they don't want it anymore," said Francis Breedon, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Lehman Brothers. \par \par \uc2  "But if they don't go down that route, they will face problems as the market will keep pushing them and they will either lose the battle or end up \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in ever larger amounts." \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice in the past few days, once on Thursday last week and more aggressively on Monday, in what traders view as a determined attempt to keep the yen caged in a four-month old range of 116.80 to 125 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the first seen since January, has been backed up by a constant volley of official rhetoric which has underlined Japan's commitment to preventing a premature yen rise from derailing the country's nascent economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  "In the long-haul it will be critical whether they sterilise or not, given that unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will show a bigger commitment to keeping the yen down," said a senior trader at a Japanese bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "If they do sterilise, the market will treat their \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and have another go at the downside on dollar/yen." \par \par \uc2  The impact of unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have all the more impact on the foreign exchanges given past experience in Switzerland. \par \par \uc2  The Swiss National Bank conducted unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb Swiss franc strength in the second half of the 1970s and succeeded in boosting money supply and curbing deflationary pressures in the process. \par \par \uc2  Nominal Swiss money-market rates were driven to zero and penalties were imposed on non-resident deposits of Swiss francs - leading, in effect, to negative interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "People say the markets have short memories but what the Swiss did has entered folklore," said Breedon at Lehman Brothers. \par \par \uc2  "Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a very powerful tool which has the power to achieve the Bank of Japan's ends and the yen will retreat almost instantaneously if people see this is what they are doing." \par \par \uc2  ((London Capital Markets, +44 171 542 6284, swaha.pattanaik@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6f06h3x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
