\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Dlr-Yen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Shows Lingering Econ Worries \b0\par\par\uc2  By Lisa Twaronite \par \uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juni 1999\par 12:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  launched a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the dollar against the yen Monday, showing that Japan is intent on protecting its exporters until it's able to kindle a sustainable economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  With domestic demand still sluggish, Japan can't afford to let a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undermine exports, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - said to amount to between $5.0 billion and $10 billion - also demonstrated continuing fears about deflationary pressures in the economy, which would be exacerbated by the recent surge in the yen. \par \par \uc2  Shortly after two top \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials warned that steps would be taken to prevent a strong yen from spoiling the nation's prospects for economic recovery, the BOJ began buying dollars aggressively. In minutes the dollar surged above the Y119 level - up from an earlier low of Y117.91. By the end of the day, after as many as half a dozen rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar was up by three yen from its lows to as high as Y120.90. \par \par \uc2  "By the end of the day, they probably bought dollars through just about every bank" in town, said a Tokyo-based dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  But some analysts warned that economic fundamentals are shifting in favor of the yen, suggesting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be fighting the tide in its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The latest round of dollar-buying came on the heels of similar efforts to buoy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Thursday, after the release of surprisingly strong Japanese economic data bolstered the yen. News that Japanese gross domestic product expanded by 1.9% on quarter in the January-March period had pushed up the yen and yields on Japanese government bonds. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 14-06-99 \par \par \uc2  1032GMT \par \par \uc2  1137 4202 62551 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6e04jdq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
